    "title": "Rat-Cat",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "There was a rat. There was a cat.",
      "The cat saw the rat. The cat ran after the rat.",
      "The rat got scared and ran. The rat went in the hole.",
      "The cat was left outside. The hole was too small."
